#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1374d629951d364124dc62fe62f11540d4457dcaa2e82f96bcd1302ce7876d6b
#. default-sha256: 1431100f8eeed3fc39e909216c67bd6802461eb339a7b42fcd144506c955644e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫접촉한 순간, ⟪k:5⟫상대방의 목숨을 앗는 저주……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48f98619ea6e6f1f9c69a59bdc3e22999626661bcc085a41a6c0145f4b5dbd51
#. default-sha256: 66b0ba0742571303f7c3e229acd51b57eaf873226632283982eabdd1d160a9da
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 마치 ⟪k:1⟫악마나 마녀……, ⟪k:2⟫부정한 자 같지 않으신지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 608e6f401f4772054f30f1cfd6b06c6546c030a8ec98a9006d1bf02aac6cd3ef
#. default-sha256: f51e4c1c7fded0df4132815689c11aabbbb9b37b98e1436b8ab82ab96134f313
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫신께선 저토록 아름다운 청년에게 ⟪k:1⟫잔혹한 안배를 하시더군요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e9c12b30c846d06a866172f51ca173e89fa2f90779bf841e433f92c43c56320
#. default-sha256: a106924ae4017066e0eb0aad53ac77bfeb660b49a684cbe9e434e4253caf43fb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그나저나 ⟪k:1⟫기이할 따름이지요. ⟪k:2⟫접촉만 해도 죽인다니…… 꼭 이야기 속 같은걸요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14bf4f70a8dc1338b8708efac167fd1340ac5bc7bcf8a936c75693858f05dc43
#. default-sha256: 52f9b2c734151c1d9f672e8b9fbfb74a77202c08544f184f16b5ac609ee2b080
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫현실미 없이 ⟪k:1⟫활자로만 구성된 이야기―― 이런 표현도 적절하겠군요. ⟪k:2⟫좀처럼 ⟪k:3⟫믿기 힘"
"든 사실입니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d59e77f66ad2e7b204bd16f7c79fc208fd6b95a03b05f99859338bc90c2df5b
#. default-sha256: 1a4cc54815fcca4629262ad7e1dd872d389a5d15adc3f02d04df22d408c41dda
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫정체 모를 현상이라도, ⟪k:2⟫미셸이 실제로 증명한 이상은 사실일 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e4044ab24fb03cf5d0a97ef3211c25b786df56e686fd6e71ec4f4dd85bb8ba8
#. default-sha256: 095b5e1deaa0326857814f08ca0adcbfda9805bae38eabc89a46f4e2e983d402
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫무릇 ⟪k:2⟫세상에는 기이한 것이 가득합니다. ⟪k:3⟫단, ⟪k:4⟫그 기이한 것들은――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b97448882a04c830f9be8c27ab336d290e8f4e8254d5b02a22069eea5d2139b7
#. default-sha256: 654495911fc4c2da53fce59ea7b25cd72459e57fb95ebe2ec2241e13babdf824
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸처럼 숨겨지기에 ⟪k:1⟫세상에 널리 알려지지 않는 것이겠습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9ab27230195f329dc42d221b0648c343f6dd28fdc4f05ad4f7d09e74c147f7e
#. default-sha256: 2e3358b1d0592c0f2fa986cf909a443f5a5e9cc6ad899f5f70ddbfe75974a8ee
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫후후……. ⟪k:1⟫또한 ⟪k:2⟫주인님께선 이미 ⟪k:3⟫기이한 현상을 많이 경험하셨지요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859d441d6292affc95aae68036f5d77329c30359ae5443eda2513c5706764d5c
#. default-sha256: e9aeefcc80abca83cae7ecbeada1a031a27c228f2642b42b3533a897af68c2c9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저와 함께 ⟪k:1⟫과거의 문을 여셨고……,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저와 함께 ⟪k:4⟫걸어다니신 그 저택만 해도……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e49f04280b3e10b088127d9c62862378128e1560dd51575971c20ccb7d81a29
#. default-sha256: 964a2dc59bce3e32cf992239d8cea21385e4e1e2da98b9c8a3ede2a4107f4555
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫또―― 저와 ⟪k:1⟫주인님의 존재도 그렇지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55114f628831aa90152fbfdc4d79d9ceddca729c2f9b04d57085e6ff346c7288
#. default-sha256: b1bf9a9e807fb9eb3aeebbf616ade6a4f05875943c3ea1355f026686080401e9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫보셨다시피 ⟪k:2⟫백발 소녀는 진정으로 저주받은 힘을 지닌 청년에게 ⟪k:3⟫어느새 마음을 "
"사로잡혔습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e90afb24d946984109750d404d0b016c3324c5ed741507c261dffed8474c3f6
#. default-sha256: 548b81ca9b7af953dc56ae75fa04a74121b97df99d4db614e5bed96ad98501a9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소녀의 고백을 들은 미셸은 ⟪k:1⟫어떻게 했을 것 같은지요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c27d9884b1afebbff996755cb245ced457cd8cf40327842035b6861040ed8000
#. default-sha256: 97404f99fb493d54de1e27798a652496d3c4b9d4751e2936d00893e49974a4c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫여지껏 타인과 교류하길 거부하던――, ⟪k:1⟫아니지요, ⟪k:2⟫교류를 못 하던 미셸이니 ⟪k:3⟫당연히 "
"⟪k:4⟫어떻게 해야 할지 갈피를 못 잡았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fcee2c98f668f2964fef6962f8d7f30394ac2b6b22862f75d3db6ec786a2c7f
#. default-sha256: 1d47e118d6e4c6cc7492709e2d402db7cb59ec25ecde79eda6898fe771feb380
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸은 잠시 무표정하게 가만히 서 있다가, ⟪k:1⟫딱 한마디,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96c10fae67841dbcdf1511a59991170ff39faa24ca80ee74bdaec94ea93e0a6e
#. default-sha256: 03da7e2702837496813b6fa3dd4f1e41b1bc9fbac763e65764edb2f7fc2a7839
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫생각해 보겠습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94436e281f3987c68dc8457d6251b00d434108fb726852ba09246107e10ccbbc
#. default-sha256: 5346bf4896fc7e36a639cf5481c5b02afe131eee9ec5e0cd8db6bbd102c40500
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 말만 하곤 ⟪k:1⟫방으로 돌아갔지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34ef9151a0d603a0f30b23df52dad1de8b2fb96075c8a6bba91c851083e65e7b
#. default-sha256: 0f207d428abfaf4a380bdc1b7757e2345a3c16fe7addd3232cd321b967e32381
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫이런 생각이 듭니다. ⟪k:2⟫미셸의 감정 표현은 매우 희박하지만―― 결코 무감정한 건 아니"
"었단 생각이요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 932c8e9e440768c9d162420ac79f1ea7e385e8fcef8056695daa6c63fa8c1648
#. default-sha256: 6d9eda4fbd3c1e4378346abced0b1d59c8b474c4706e71296cfd4576187b5923
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫몹시 오랜 시간을 ⟪k:1⟫홀로 지냈기에 ⟪k:2⟫표정을 어떻게 짓는지도 잊은 걸 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c9457166271403445de096cd719cf705ddd8e936b5df450dfe3ff70cbbc5b04
#. default-sha256: a37fba7fdedcde241ce946dcb9ade0a4f2de0047af97bf610e17253257114c1e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇기에 ⟪k:1⟫제가 생각건대―― 이때 미셸은 ⟪k:2⟫엄청나게 동요했을 거랍니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a6daf1e9fda3d53148e29380aca47c412019758c8d77744d6b33e56d9a3a278
#. default-sha256: eed82c6d7d42466796c36f49911e603364f0986ca98e2892089e9daf31b3cc62
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸에게는 ⟪k:1⟫이해가 안 될 말을 잇따라서 들은 거였으니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ba591c585980d63bd59e1f52ff6543acd86984e1c40ada878230f61bd9302da
#. default-sha256: 3df6e2387d0e7165ca2c2d59d9d723cfa532df0ccde3b605486ba4966771ef5a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫본인의 비밀을 알고도 ⟪k:1⟫이 저택에 있겠다는 말……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1661830f1757a2c18a5e42bd368523a7ba4c6616929c1a0c2f0f9b85ec44473f
#. default-sha256: bb4bacc5b9ec1365589d02eb992c110e7e86a8d04a2fa75e86649f25682e04e7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫본인의 비밀을 알고도 ⟪k:2⟫좋아한다는 말."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fed09516fa285786c870d010650bba131231ab4d5e4f0a3cdddaa206e3e0d8a
#. default-sha256: dd8d49a2d2f5c29d93da7d2429d06bb65f9e89b7865fe09ce779cd79584bd182
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀의 입에서 나온 ⟪k:1⟫“좋아한다”는 말에는 ⟪k:2⟫열띠고 경망스러운 기색이 없었습니다. ⟪k:3⟫훨"
"씬 따스하여 ⟪k:4⟫포근히 감싸는 듯했지요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c27cba2982f5e9ea24bfff1fe5eae2a158cba92eccd6a049833d3fe3979411f1
#. default-sha256: 82d35a77394266db59736ba81dbe39ea9672d24d36111d692ffc812deb33c776
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
